sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Sidecar as Routing Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Allowlist as AllowlistValidator
    participant Prefiller as Remote Prefill Worker<br/>HTTP(S)
    participant Decoder as Local vLLM Decoder<br/>8001/TCP HTTP(S)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over K8sAPI,Allowlist: SSRF Allowlist Maintenance (Background)
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: Watch InferencePool events<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Allowlist: Watch Pod events (label selector)<br/>ServiceAccount token
    Allowlist->>Allowlist: Rebuild allowlist<br/>(pod IPs + names)

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 1: Disaggregated Prefill/Decode (NIXL v2)
    Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Header: x-prefiller-host-port
    Sidecar->>Allowlist: Validate prefiller host
    Allowlist-->>Sidecar: Allowed (or 403)
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: Generate UUID<br/>Rewrite body: max_tokens=1, stream=false
    Sidecar->>Prefiller: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Prefill-only request with KV params
    Prefiller-->>Sidecar: Prefill response<br/>kv_transfer_params in body
    Sidecar->>Sidecar: Extract kv_transfer_params<br/>Restore original streaming/token settings
    Sidecar->>Decoder: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Decode request with KV transfer metadata
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference response (streaming)
    Sidecar-->>Client: Inference response

    Note over Client,Decoder: Flow 2: Passthrough (No Prefill Header)
    Client->>Sidecar: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>No x-prefiller-host-port header
    Sidecar->>Decoder: Reverse proxy passthrough
    Decoder-->>Sidecar: Inference response
    Sidecar-->>Client: Inference response
